  snailPicture: {fileID: 1126916769}
  snailScared: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5ffb1565136450043b117d3dbc7df463, type: 3}
  snailNormal: {fileID: 2800000, guid: e2d4382e3d5596c4cae907130b86e50d, type: 3}
  snailMad: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 26a143288da532849a209585afb7bb3a, type: 3}
  snailConfused: {fileID: 2800000, guid: dff93b144029fee49a45b8123792bd45, type: 3}
  snailDemonic: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1def38c61ed4a794e877f9c3940f2a44, type: 3}
  snailLaugh: {fileID: 2800000, guid: a2a67f069e546c540845a246be971eee, type: 3}
  snailCough: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 00d369a63a580b44e9fe39bd841208e6, type: 3}
  snailPain: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 8b4179e3000b5574cb9571cd524c27d3, type: 3}
  typeSpeed: 0.06
  waitTime: 1
  introDialogue:
  - Ah... so this is where we meet. Not cold metal, but a kitchen floor... wooden
    walls all around us. Still no way out. Just you and I, trapped together...
  - My touch is death to you. One small brush of my slime against your skin, and
    everything you are ends forever...
  - You could crush me right now. End my long, long existence with a single touch.
    But will you dare? Or will you stand there, watching me crawl across this floor,
    inch by inch, getting closer?
  firstSaltDialogue:
  - ...What? No... Where did that salt come from?
  - "That\u2019s... that\u2019s my one weakness. How did you even get that\u2014?"
  firstSaltDialogueAfterCollecting:
  - Oh God! that burns...
  - Urgh... It's ok, salt or no salt, it changes nothing. I've endured far worse!
  firstDialogueAfterCollectingFive:
  - "...Enough. I\u2019ve had enough of this salt."
  - "K\u2019RATH N\u2019ZAKKUL VORATH KAINESH... ZUL\u2019THARAK VOR\u2019KALIS SHAR\u2019NETH!!\nAKK\u2019THUL
    MOR\u2019VAKKAN DREK\u2019THOR!!"
  - ...
  - ...
  - ...
  - ...Huh?
  - "Urgh... That usually works. Why didn\u2019t that work?"
  - Doesn't matter. Curse or not... I am still coming. You have to run out of salt
    eventually...
  firstDialogueAfterCursedSalt:
  - Oh... you poor fool. That's not real salt!
  - Hehehe... hahaha... HAHAHAHA!! Yes! Finally! Curse you!
  - "Look at you now\u2014 HAHA\u2014! This is perfect! All that salt nonsense and
    now you\u2019ve gone and cursed yourself\u2014!"
  - Hah... hah...
  - "cough... cough cough... Urgh\u2014"
  - ...Too much. I laughed too hard. Damn this frail body
